#, python-format
msgid "A customer needs a %(field)s while e-invoicing is on."
msgstr "开启电子发票后，客户必须填写%(field)s。"

msgid "A TIN is checked together with an ID type and an ID value."
msgstr "税务识别号需要连同证件类型和证件号码一起核对。"

msgid ""
"MyInvois cannot be reached right now, so the TIN could not be checked. "
"Nothing was saved. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"暂时无法连接 MyInvois，无法核对税务识别号，未保存任何内容。请几分钟后再试。"

msgid "MyInvois refused the TIN check. Nothing was saved. Contact support."
msgstr "MyInvois 拒绝了税务识别号核对，未保存任何内容。请联系支持。"

msgid "MyInvois does not accept the format of this TIN."
msgstr "MyInvois 不接受该税务识别号的格式。"

msgid "MyInvois has no taxpayer with this TIN and ID."
msgstr "MyInvois 中没有使用该税务识别号和证件的纳税人。"

msgid "This customer was changed by someone else. Reload it and try again."
msgstr "该客户刚被其他人修改。请刷新后重试。"

msgid ""
"I understand that this company is a mandatory e-invoicing taxpayer. "
"Switching e-invoicing off means its invoices will not be sent to LHDN "
"MyInvois, and I am responsible for the consequences under the Income Tax Act "
"and the e-invoice guidelines."
msgstr ""
"我了解本公司属于强制实施电子发票的纳税人。关闭电子发票意味着其发票将不会提交"
"至 LHDN MyInvois，我须承担《所得税法》及电子发票指南下的相关后果。"

